      "name": "spi (pi): a chip enable transaction is select, bytes, deselect, and on_done reports once",
      "only": [
        "pi"
      ],
      "why_only": "the Pi's SPI form: the guest's SPI <bus> <ce> X <hex> line, replayed on the responder's pseudo select",
      "steps": [
        {
          "op": "call",
          "fn": "set_auto_arm",
          "args": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "ce",
          "mosi": [
            1,
            2,
            3
          ],
          "miso": [
            160,
            161,
            162
          ],
          "hold": false
        },
        {
          "op": "trace",
          "expect": [
            "pin CS=0",
            "spi_done h=0 n=3 buf=own",
            "spi_rx 0=01",
            "spi_rx 1=02",
            "spi_rx 2=03",
            "pin CS=1"
          ],
          "why": "the CE falls, the chip arms, three bytes, the CE rises: the chip's vx_spi_stop on the rise finds the frame complete and reports nothing more"
        },
        {
          "op": "ce",
          "mosi": [
            5
          ],
          "miso": [
            160
          ],
          "hold": true
        },
